{"path":"string/basic_string_view/front","title":"std::basic_string_view<CharT,Traits>::front","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string_view&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>front","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view/front","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Returns reference to the first character in the view. The behavior is undefined if empty() == true.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> const_reference front<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns reference to the first character in the view. The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">empty<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Reference to the first character, equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string_view&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</sp